# Fallback for `docker compose up -d` by hand — Komodo writes odoo/.env itself from
# komodo/stacks/odoo.toml (see CLAUDE.md's "Secrets via Komodo Variables").
# Docs: https://www.odoo.com/documentation/19.0/ | https://hub.docker.com/_/odoo

## Image version is pinned in docker-compose.yml, not here — see CLAUDE.md.

POSTGRES_DB=postgres
POSTGRES_USER=odoo
## CHANGE before deploying — generate with `openssl rand -base64 32`.
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=changeme
